{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "db1b1331-eed6-8aeb-a029-c3bebef4bb0c",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T10:00:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Omar Goldberg",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:56:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:56:30-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise, good morning. Omar Goldberg, I'm over on Eustis Avenue, number 48, up on the Hill. I've got a drain problem at the curb out front and, well, it's kind of a mess, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:56:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, tell me what you're seeing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:56:48-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the grate at the curb has sunk. It's down lower than the pavement around it, like somebody pulled the ground out from under it. And when it rains, the water goes everywhere except down the thing. It runs right past it. After that nor'easter Friday into Saturday, three days ago now, it was a river out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:57:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And it's still a problem now that the rain's stopped?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:57:16-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the water's gone, but the sidewalk is a sheet of mud and grit. Just slick, all of it. And this keeps happening, every time we get a real storm it does the same thing and nobody comes out. You'd think after a while somebody would look."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:57:35-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Has anyone from the city been out to look at that grate before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:57:42-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I know of. I've been in the house a long time. My father used to say the street department was the only crew that ever shoveled this block, back in, oh, the nineties when I was, hang on, I'm wandering. Sorry. Anyway, no, nobody's come."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:58:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fine. So the grate is sunken, water bypasses it, and there's silt left on the sidewalk. Is the water getting into your house or just the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:58:13-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the street and the sidewalk, thank goodness. But it's a hazard. People walk by here, there's a school up the way. Which reminds me, my kid's school mascot is a seagull, and she's been after me for the seagull costume for the spirit day, and I couldn't get down the sidewalk without nearly going on my backside carrying the thing to the car. [pause] Sorry, that's a tangent."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:58:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A seagull, I like it. Okay, so I can put in a work order for a crew to inspect the drain and the sidewalk. Can you give me the best cross street near you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:58:55-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's, um, the grate is right in front of 48, on the street side by the curb. Closer to the corner side of our property, if that helps. I don't have a cross street handy, I'm bad with that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:59:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, 48 Eustis is enough. And a number where they can reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:59:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0178. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:59:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0178. I'll note the grate is sunk, water is bypassing it, and there's mud and grit across the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:59:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And so who do I call if it gets worse? Or is it you, is this the right place to get it checked?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:59:41-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're in the right place. Call this line again and mention the work order for 48 Eustis. Crews are working through a backlog after the storm, so it may be a few days before someone gets there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T09:59:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days. Okay. I just wish it didn't take a storm and a pile of mud every time. But I appreciate you writing it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:00:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. If it rains again before they come, call and let us know, and we'll flag it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:00:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks, Denise. Tell the crew to watch the sidewalk, it's slippery."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:00:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that in the notes. Take care, Mr. Goldberg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T10:00:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
